# Gev's counters are "for each opponent who lost life this turn": in a three-player game Bot1 bolts Bot2 and Bot3 (each loses
# 3, to 17), so an Ornithopter entering afterwards gets two +1/+1 counters, a 2/4 (CR 614.1c, 122.6). Two bolts on one
# opponent would count that opponent once; here each of the two has lost life.

